<xt>
  <head>
    <!-- Layout template: main menu, 1280 x 720 (docs/design/30-ui-project.md 30.2 class 4).
         A vertical list on the left is the most common main-menu layout (36 of 113 surveyed
         screens, docs/reference/ui-survey-2026-09/report.md); centred lists come second.
           Left      title, subtitle and the vertical Button list (Size L)
           Art       key art or a live scene (`<external source="scene-view:menu">`)
           TopRight  news / notifications
           BottomLeft  version, BottomRight  input hints (InputGlyph)
         Replace the guide boxes with standard symbols. -->
    <style>
      body { width: 100vw; height: 100vh; font-family: var(--font-family); }
      #Screen { position: relative; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
      .anchor {
        position: absolute;
        display: flex;
        border-width: var(--border-w);
        border-color: var(--color-border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-s);
      }
      .guide { color: var(--color-text-dim); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); padding: var(--space-1); }
      #Left { left: 96px; top: 120px; width: 320px; height: 440px; }
      #Art { left: 480px; top: 96px; width: 640px; height: 480px; }
      #TopRight { right: var(--safe-x); top: var(--safe-y); width: 340px; height: 72px; }
      #BottomLeft { left: var(--safe-x); bottom: var(--safe-y); width: 200px; height: 24px; }
      #BottomRight { right: var(--safe-x); bottom: var(--safe-y); width: 280px; height: 32px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="Screen">
      <div id="Left" class="anchor"><span id="LeftGuide" class="guide">Left: title and menu list</span></div>
      <div id="Art" class="anchor"><span id="ArtGuide" class="guide">Art</span></div>
      <div id="TopRight" class="anchor"><span id="TopRightGuide" class="guide">TopRight</span></div>
      <div id="BottomLeft" class="anchor"><span id="BottomLeftGuide" class="guide">BottomLeft</span></div>
      <div id="BottomRight" class="anchor"><span id="BottomRightGuide" class="guide">BottomRight</span></div>
    </div>
  </body>
</xt>
